       },
       "body": "<!-- prism:finding:svc/store.go:2:f6f6f6f6f6f6 -->\n**MEDIUM** The buyer lookup in `recordBulk` hardcodes `purchaserID`, but every other purchase read branches on `PURCHASER_READ_SWAP` and falls back to `userID`. The `purchaserID` column can be null for rows written before the backfill ran, so with the switch off the fanout lookup misses older buyers.",
       "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:00:00Z",
       "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:00:00Z",
       "path": "svc/store.go",
