      {
       "databaseId": 602,
       "author": {
        "login": "dev"
       },
       "body": "This is intentional. The purchaserID backfill is done in prod (zero nulls and zero mismatches verified) and PURCHASER_READ_SWAP is on for both writes and the viewer ownership check, so the switch-off state this describes does not exist anymore.",
